{"overview":"تانجیرو کامادو، همراه با اینوسوکه هاشی‌بِرا، پسری که توسط خرس‌ها بزرگ شده و سر خرس می‌پوشاند، و زِنِتسو آگاتسُما، پسری ترسناک که قدرت واقعی‌اش را در خواب نشان می‌دهد، در قطار بی‌نهایت به ماموریت جدیدی می‌پیوندد؛ با هاشی آتش، کیوجورو رِنگوکُ، برای شکست دادن شیاطینی که مردم را آزار می‌دهد و شیاطین‌کشانی را که در برابر آن ایستاده‌اند، می‌کشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Tanjiro Kamado, joined with Inosuke Hashibira, a boy raised by boars who wears a boar's head, and Zenitsu Agatsuma, a scared boy who reveals his true power when he sleeps, boards the Infinity Train on a new mission with the Fire Hashira, Kyojuro Rengoku, to defeat a demon who has been tormenting the people and killing the demon slayers who oppose it!","tagline_en":"With your blade, bring an end to the nightmare.","runtime":117,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["外崎春雄"],"crew_en":["Haruo Sotozaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"花江夏樹","role":"Tanjiro Kamado (voice)","photo":"/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg","en":"Natsuki Hanae"},{"name":"鬼頭明里","role":"Nezuko Kamado (voice)","photo":"/AoRQOZRC0yINB0WeKnM569rV1wF.jpg","en":"Akari Kito"},{"name":"下野紘","role":"Zenitsu Agatsuma (voice)","photo":"/yrSDcgFefHtWkFmLnTrcw2t0MV.jpg","en":"Hiro Shimono"},{"name":"松岡禎丞","role":"Inosuke Hashibira (voice)","photo":"/ugDwdWEXnmv43jcbnfAi4XwiQ8C.jpg","en":"Yoshitsugu Matsuoka"},{"name":"日野聡","role":"Kyojuro Rengoku (voice)","photo":"/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg","en":"Satoshi Hino"},{"name":"櫻井孝宏","role":"Giyu Tomioka (voice)","photo":"/8s8owcKmpRAuhzEGjSdRpztthUg.jpg","en":"Takahiro Sakurai"},{"name":"کاتسویوکی کونیشی","role":"Tengen Uzui (voice)","photo":"/nYM5cH6U7cp4x9dIzW0enmEKmeV.jpg","en":"Katsuyuki Konishi"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"Shinobu Kocho (voice)","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"鈴村健一","role":"Obanai Iguro (voice)","photo":"/vFqjmIjxfgBkh3ZmUin7QETV0sy.jpg","en":"Kenichi Suzumura"},{"name":"関智一","role":"Sanemi Sh